1
00:00:00,068 --> 00:00:02,208
(Howard:)I can't believe we're not going.

2
00:00:03,238 --> 00:00:04,578
(Sheldon:)It's okay.

3
00:00:05,373 --> 00:00:07,823
There-there's always WonderCon
in Anaheim.

4
00:00:09,811 --> 00:00:11,351
(Sheldon:)That's just as good.

5
00:00:12,747 --> 00:00:14,197
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

6
00:00:20,488 --> 00:00:23,158
(Penny:)Guys, this is really sad.

7
00:00:23,758 --> 00:00:26,398
(Penny:)And in a different way
than it was 20 minutes ago.

8
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:32,570
(Sheldon:)I can't believe we wasted all
that time on our Hulk costumes.

9
00:00:32,734 --> 00:00:34,714
(Penny:)What? You were all going as the Hulk?

10
00:00:34,869 --> 00:00:36,109
(Howard:)Not the same Hulk.

11
00:00:36,538 --> 00:00:38,418
(Howard:)Ferrigno, Bana, Norton and Ruffalo.

12
00:00:41,176 --> 00:00:44,286
(Raj:)We would have been the angry green
belles of the masquerade ball.

13
00:00:45,613 --> 00:00:47,113
(Penny:)-Yeah.
-Yeah.

14
00:00:48,616 --> 00:00:50,896
(Penny:)And we're back
to the first kind of sad.

15
00:00:54,022 --> 00:00:58,472
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, I have the solution
to our Comic-Con problem.

16
00:00:58,626 --> 00:01:00,126
(Sheldon:)We don't need them.

